1. 内容(Content) — CC BY 4.0
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

适用范围:`data/*.json` 中的 note / 战线卡 / 误读标记等编者撰写的文字,
`template.html` 中的正文散文,`README.md`,以及生成的时间线森林图的
结构与呈现。

Applies to: the editorial prose in `data/*.json` (notes, front cards,
misread annotations), the body copy in `template.html`, `README.md`,
and the structure and presentation of the generated timeline graph.

