3. 书目信息(Bibliographic data) — 无权利主张
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

论文标题、作者、年份、venue、arXiv id、URL 属于事实性信息,不受版权保护,
本项目对其不主张任何权利。这些论文本身的著作权归各自作者所有;本项目仅
链接到原文,不复制论文正文或图表。页面中出现的少量原文短句引用,均标注
出处并用于评论目的。

Paper titles, authors, years, venues, arXiv identifiers and URLs are facts
and are not subject to copyright; no rights are claimed over them. Copyright
in the cited papers remains with their respective authors. This project links
to originals and reproduces no paper body text or figures. The few short
verbatim quotations that appear are attributed and used for commentary.
